<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E signs $11 mln Russian deal.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E signs $11 mln Russian deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA signed an $11 million contract with a Russian firm  Perekryostok to build a warehouse, Mostostal said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It did not say where the warehouse would be built.</p>
<p>Mostostal said the works would be carried out in 11 months in cooperation with its subsidiaries and affiliates and other construction firms.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
